  Water, for her part, got more than anyone, and became, next to Sun, the most powerful force on earth.\r\n\r\n-From a plaque next to Takakk\aw Falls, Yoho National Park, British Columbia, Canada\r\n␀)/K[579 0 R 580 0 R 581 0 R 582 0 R 583 0 R 584 0 R 585 0 R]/P 10166 0 R/S/TextBox>>endobj586 0 obj<</A 10317 0 R/C/Header/K 0/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Header>>endobj602 0 obj<</A 10319 0 R/Alt()/K 16/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Shape>>endobj587 0 obj<</A 10320 0 R/C/Header/K 1/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Header>>endobj588 0 obj<</A 10321 0 R/C/Header/K 2/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Header>>endobj589 0 obj<</A 10322 0 R/C/Header/K 3/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Header>>endobj590 0 obj<</A 10323 0 R/C/Normal#20#28Web#29/K 4/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Normal#20#28Web#29>>endobj591 0 obj<</A 10324 0 R/C/Normal#20#28Web#29/K 5/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Normal#20#28Web#29>>endobj592 0 obj<</A 10325 0 R/C/Normal#20#28Web#29/K 6/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Normal#20#28Web#29>>endobj593 0 obj<</A 10326 0 R/C/Normal#20#28Web#29/K 7/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Normal#20#28Web#29>>endobj599 0 obj<</A 10327 0 R/Alt()/K 13/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Shape>>endobj594 0 obj<</A 10328 0 R/C/xl24/K 8/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/xl24>>endobj595 0 obj<</C/Normal/K 9/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Normal>>endobj596 0 obj<</A 10329 0 R/C/Body#20Text/K 10/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Body#20Text>>endobj597 0 obj<</C/Body#20Text/K 11/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Body#20Text>>endobj598 0 obj<</A 10330 0 R/C/Body#20Text/K 12/P 10166 0 R/Pg 10318 0 R/S/Body#20Text>>endobj10207 0 obj<</Alt(Text Box: Trace of the old canal in Greenville\r\nphoto courtesy of Nathan Leary, 1999\r\n␀)/K[600 0 R 601 0 R]/P 10166 0 R/S/TextBox>>endobj10208 0 obj<</Alt(Text Box: A portion of the Shenango River watershed␀)/K 603 0 R/P 10166 0 R/S/TextBox>>endobj10209 0 obj<</A 10331 0 R/K[10332 0 R 10333 0 R 10334 0 R 10335 0 R 10336 0 R 10337 0 R 10338 0 R 10339 0 R 10340 0 R 10